[0.0-3.8] caller: This is Officer Grant calling from the IRS about unpaid taxes.
[4.4-6.2] elder: I always pay my taxes.
[6.8-12.0] caller: Our records show you owe four thousand dollars. There is a warrant for your arrest.
[12.6-14.1] elder: That can't be right.
[14.7-19.9] caller: To stop the arrest you must pay today with gift cards. Do not hang up.
[20.5-22.3] elder: Can I call you back?
[22.9-26.4] caller: You don't need to call anyone. Stay on the line.
